<section class="about-hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE ABOUT ME</p><h1>People, systems<br/>and the space<br/><em>between them.</em></h1><p class="about-lede">I’m Mariana, a Senior Service Designer based in Lisbon. I work across service strategy, discovery and digital transformation.</p></div></section>

