<section class="experience-section section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENT EXPERIENCE</p><h2>Working across<br/><em>different systems.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href={withBase('assets/mariana-bacelo-cv.pdf')} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Full experience in my CV ↗</a></div><div class="experience-row"><span>MAY 2026 TO PRESENT</span><div><h3>AstraZeneca</h3><p>Service Design Consultant · Independent contractor</p></div><p>Discovery across pharmaceutical R&amp;D: connecting legacy workflows, data dependencies, intake and resource allocation.</p></div><div class="experience-row"><span>MAY 2025 TO PRESENT</span><div><h3>Instituto de Informática, I.P.</h3><p>Service Design Consultant · Independent contractor</p></div><p>Research with citizens and staff, service insight and measurement for Portuguese Social Security.</p></div><div class="experience-row"><span>JAN 2023 TO MAY 2025</span><div><h3>Ilegra</h3><p>CX Strategist</p></div><p>Research, customer experience and strategy across industrial and financial-sector initiatives.</p></div><div class="experience-row"><span>JUL 2021 TO JAN 2023</span><div><h3>Ilegra</h3><p>Senior Product Designer</p></div><p>Digital product design, design systems and UX writing for financial services.</p></div></section>

